    "identity_note": "論文為Shridhar、Manuelli、Fox的Perceiver-Actor: A Multi-Task Transformer for Robotic Manipulation，arXiv:2209.05451v2（2022-11-11）。README題名、作者、arXiv與peract.github.io相符；84–109明指MohitShridhar/RLBench及MohitShridhar/YARR的peract分支，不是P062的stepjam/RLBench現行快照。兩fork是執行／計分依賴。",
